WEBVTT

00:30.883 --> 00:34.433
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:34.453 --> 00:37.833
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.103 --> 00:44.073
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.233 --> 00:48.863
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:48.883 --> 00:52.393
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:52.413 --> 00:55.903
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:55.923 --> 00:59.433
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

00:59.453 --> 01:05.513
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:18.773 --> 01:23.053
Si Jin

01:23.073 --> 01:27.053
Episode 2

01:27.053 --> 01:29.773
(Virtues Run Far)

01:34.183 --> 01:36.873
Xiao, although Si's engaged,

01:36.873 --> 01:37.913
it's better

01:37.913 --> 01:39.143
to return the betrothal gifts

01:39.143 --> 01:40.953
to Duke An's Mansion

01:40.953 --> 01:43.063
and cancel the engagement.

01:43.593 --> 01:45.233
They've been

01:45.593 --> 01:47.183
used up.

01:48.593 --> 01:50.343
What?

01:50.423 --> 01:51.593
Your branch isn't in charge.

01:51.593 --> 01:54.183
You don't know how much we cost daily.

01:55.473 --> 01:58.523
You've barely had any income these years.

01:58.543 --> 02:01.113
Your son loafs around every day.

02:01.113 --> 02:03.263
Look at everything

02:03.263 --> 02:04.423
in this mansion.

02:04.423 --> 02:06.723
Nothing is free.

02:06.743 --> 02:09.393
Mother went for Buddhist meditation

02:09.393 --> 02:10.963
in the mountain earlier.

02:10.983 --> 02:12.873
That cost money, too.

02:12.873 --> 02:14.963
- But...
- You don't believe me?

02:14.983 --> 02:16.503
Here are the accounts.

02:16.673 --> 02:18.713
Show him.

02:19.073 --> 02:21.503
Here you are, Master.

02:22.263 --> 02:23.743
The betrothal gifts

02:23.743 --> 02:24.953
are better than nothing.

02:24.953 --> 02:27.403
Your branch has finally
contributed to our mansion.

02:27.423 --> 02:28.583
If you insist

02:28.583 --> 02:29.933
on returning them,

02:29.953 --> 02:32.183
you'll be pushing all of us

02:32.233 --> 02:33.793
off the cliff

02:33.793 --> 02:36.173
- But...
- into the abyss.

02:36.193 --> 02:37.373
I understand.

02:37.393 --> 02:39.353
It's not easy to manage

02:39.353 --> 02:41.033
the entire household,

02:41.073 --> 02:43.303
but those gifts are given to Si.

02:43.303 --> 02:44.393
How could you...?

02:44.393 --> 02:45.563
Brother,

02:45.583 --> 02:46.893
are you blaming me?

02:46.893 --> 02:47.793
(List of Gifts)

02:47.793 --> 02:49.143
Here's the list of those gifts.

02:49.143 --> 02:50.333
Check the items.

02:50.353 --> 02:51.463
If anything is missing,

02:51.463 --> 02:52.703
make up for the losses.

02:52.703 --> 02:54.653
Then return everything to cancel

02:54.673 --> 02:55.893
the engagement.

02:55.913 --> 02:56.813
I...

02:56.833 --> 02:58.093
I almost forgot.

02:58.113 --> 02:59.613
This is one of the gifts, too.

02:59.633 --> 03:01.433
Return it as well!

03:02.673 --> 03:05.053
- You...
- It's hard

03:05.073 --> 03:07.453
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)
to manage everything!

03:15.863 --> 03:17.683
I'm so useless.

03:17.703 --> 03:20.273
Don't blame yourself, Father.

03:21.303 --> 03:23.033
I believe

03:23.303 --> 03:24.993
she must've

03:25.463 --> 03:27.433
hidden the gifts somewhere.

03:30.463 --> 03:32.313
I'll figure out a way

03:32.353 --> 03:34.103
to find them.

03:36.393 --> 03:37.993
But I need to

03:38.263 --> 03:40.623
borrow Mother's dowry.

03:42.263 --> 03:43.793
Do my hairpin and pendant

03:43.793 --> 03:45.383
- match?
- Of course.

03:46.703 --> 03:47.813
What about my dress?

03:47.833 --> 03:49.193
Stunning.

03:49.743 --> 03:52.333
I'm going for an outing
with those noble ladies tomorrow.

03:52.353 --> 03:53.893
I cannot be overshadowed by them.

03:53.913 --> 03:55.593
I'll wear this outfit.

04:12.553 --> 04:14.103
Cousin Si.

04:15.023 --> 04:16.243
Greetings, Cousin Pei.

04:16.263 --> 04:18.473
Aman, serve her tea.

04:18.473 --> 04:19.833
Yes.

04:23.103 --> 04:26.033
You seem to be in a good mood,

04:26.663 --> 04:28.833
and you're dressed up.

04:36.193 --> 04:37.393
How come I never saw

04:37.393 --> 04:39.053
you wear such jewelry before?

04:39.513 --> 04:42.073
I'm simply wearing them for fun.

04:42.263 --> 04:44.073
You look nice, too,

04:44.223 --> 04:46.733
although your hairpin

04:46.753 --> 04:48.243
and bracelet

04:48.263 --> 04:50.003
are less classy.

04:50.023 --> 04:51.853
You're gorgeous.

04:51.873 --> 04:53.223
It's a shame

04:53.223 --> 04:55.123
that they don't bring out your beauty.

04:55.143 --> 04:57.003
Don't be so condescending.

04:57.023 --> 04:59.053
I picked the headwear randomly

04:59.073 --> 05:01.083
and threw it on.

05:01.103 --> 05:02.183
The better ones are

05:02.183 --> 05:03.533
kept in my room.

05:03.553 --> 05:04.633
I'm not a show-off

05:04.633 --> 05:05.683
like you.

05:05.703 --> 05:07.063
Is that so?

05:07.343 --> 05:08.863
I doubt it.

05:09.313 --> 05:11.003
If you had better ones,

05:11.023 --> 05:12.193
wouldn't you wear them

05:12.193 --> 05:13.443
and show them off?

05:13.463 --> 05:14.753
You have nothing valuable

05:14.753 --> 05:17.533
and wear those cheap ones instead.

05:17.553 --> 05:18.913
You...

05:20.433 --> 05:21.793
Just you wait.

05:24.073 --> 05:25.673
Miss, where are you going?

05:25.673 --> 05:27.033
Leave me alone!

05:29.343 --> 05:30.183
Aman.

05:30.193 --> 05:31.553
Yes.

05:38.433 --> 05:40.223
Stop rushing me! Come on!

05:40.223 --> 05:42.343
You don't know what to do without me?

06:03.023 --> 06:04.983
I'll return it as soon as I'm done.

06:18.093 --> 06:20.573
(Listen to the Rain)

06:22.903 --> 06:24.593
How did it go, Aman?

06:30.143 --> 06:32.033
Gather some strong servants.

06:48.313 --> 06:49.673
Stop!

06:53.663 --> 06:56.153
How audacious of you!

06:56.343 --> 06:58.643
Who told you to move these out?

06:58.663 --> 07:00.953
How dare you touch the betrothal gifts!

07:01.263 --> 07:02.613
Aunt Xiao,

07:02.633 --> 07:04.193
those gifts belong to our branch.

07:04.193 --> 07:06.193
Now, we're moving them out.

07:06.633 --> 07:08.023
Is there a problem?

07:08.023 --> 07:10.633
We're family.

07:10.873 --> 07:12.853
Everything in the warehouse

07:12.873 --> 07:15.193
belongs to Earl Dongping's Mansion!

07:15.193 --> 07:17.103
Are you saying

07:17.313 --> 07:18.513
you mean to

07:18.513 --> 07:20.303
hog my betrothal gifts?

07:23.143 --> 07:24.443
Wait.

07:24.463 --> 07:26.973
(Jiang Anmou, Earl Dongping's Brother)
Father said

07:26.993 --> 07:28.413
you had used up

07:28.433 --> 07:30.173
all of them.

07:30.193 --> 07:31.793
He went to great lengths

07:31.793 --> 07:34.303
to buy these to fill the gap.

07:34.433 --> 07:36.273
They have nothing

07:36.463 --> 07:38.393
to do with you.

07:39.193 --> 07:40.313
- Move them.
- I dare you!

07:40.313 --> 07:42.473
Who dares to stop them?

07:44.633 --> 07:46.003
Brother,

07:46.023 --> 07:47.973
I'm glad you're here.

07:47.993 --> 07:49.813
Look at these servants.

07:49.833 --> 07:50.793
Look how wild

07:50.793 --> 07:52.563
and audacious they are.

07:52.583 --> 07:54.563
They're moving things out

07:54.583 --> 07:56.203
from our warehouse.

07:56.223 --> 07:58.633
This is Earl Dongping's Mansion.

07:59.023 --> 08:00.203
After all,

08:00.223 --> 08:02.853
I, Earl Dongping, own it.

08:02.873 --> 08:05.973
You're only managing the household for now.

08:05.993 --> 08:08.173
I hushed up your branch meaning to

08:08.193 --> 08:09.833
pocket the betrothal gifts,

08:09.873 --> 08:11.473
but I won't let it slide.

08:11.473 --> 08:13.543
Did you see me

08:13.633 --> 08:15.583
pocketing those gifts?

08:15.583 --> 08:17.443
Don't push me,

08:17.463 --> 08:19.193
or I'll turn nasty!

08:19.193 --> 08:21.033
Mother made me take charge!

08:21.033 --> 08:23.473
She can talk to me!

08:24.103 --> 08:25.813
Enough. Stop arguing.

08:25.833 --> 08:28.143
Calm down, both of you.

08:28.383 --> 08:29.653
Brother,

08:29.673 --> 08:30.703
my wife wants

08:30.703 --> 08:33.383
the best for our mansion.

08:33.793 --> 08:36.623
Now that Brother has decided to

08:36.623 --> 08:38.013
cancel the engagement,

08:38.033 --> 08:39.953
let him go.

08:40.833 --> 08:42.343
Darling.

08:44.433 --> 08:45.933
Brother,

08:45.953 --> 08:48.473
I have a question, though.

08:49.103 --> 08:50.073
I wonder

08:50.073 --> 08:52.253
if you alone

08:52.273 --> 08:53.913
can cancel

08:53.913 --> 08:55.983
the engagement.

08:57.703 --> 08:59.623
What if Duke An's Mansion disagrees?

09:00.863 --> 09:03.473
The betrothal gifts are a lot.

09:03.673 --> 09:05.683
If we move them back and forth,

09:05.703 --> 09:06.993
won't others

09:06.993 --> 09:09.473
laugh at our two clans?

09:10.343 --> 09:11.983
You do have a point.

09:11.983 --> 09:12.843
See?

09:12.863 --> 09:15.723
Nevertheless, I have to return them first.

09:15.743 --> 09:17.913
- Brother...
- Move.

09:24.693 --> 09:30.293
(Capital Security Office)

09:30.293 --> 09:32.773
(Strict and Just)

09:37.773 --> 09:40.573
(Zhen Heng,
Vice Prefect of Capital Security Office)

09:49.503 --> 09:53.263
(Upright and Fair)
Your token and official seal,

09:53.743 --> 09:55.593
Commandant Yu.

09:56.433 --> 09:58.053
From now on,

09:58.073 --> 09:59.773
we'll be colleagues.

09:59.793 --> 10:01.653
As the Vice Prefect of this office,

10:01.673 --> 10:02.813
I head the East Yamen.

10:02.833 --> 10:04.963
I hear and judge cases

10:04.983 --> 10:06.713
and process paperwork.

10:11.673 --> 10:13.713
You'll head the West Yamen.

10:13.833 --> 10:15.133
Security patrol

10:15.153 --> 10:17.013
and arrest are your duties.

10:17.033 --> 10:18.443
But always remember

10:18.463 --> 10:20.053
to obey the East Yamen

10:20.073 --> 10:21.473
and follow orders.

10:24.433 --> 10:25.503
To facilitate

10:25.503 --> 10:26.953
our cooperation in the future,

10:26.953 --> 10:29.433
I've listed all the things

10:29.433 --> 10:30.913
you should look out for.

10:35.863 --> 10:37.223
This is long.

10:39.193 --> 10:42.313
Sorry for troubling you, Mr. Zhen.

10:42.503 --> 10:43.843
No trouble at all.

10:43.863 --> 10:45.133
Commandant Yu,

10:45.153 --> 10:46.983
I'll break down the rules for you.

10:47.223 --> 10:49.293
The Yamen opens at the Mao hour

10:49.313 --> 10:50.723
and closes before dusk daily.

10:50.743 --> 10:53.103
Absenteeism isn't allowed.

10:53.383 --> 10:54.233
We shall meet

10:54.233 --> 10:55.933
every morning and night

10:55.953 --> 10:57.773
to decide today's work

10:57.793 --> 11:00.503
and discuss the plan for tomorrow.

11:02.313 --> 11:03.673
Sure.

11:06.863 --> 11:08.343
We'll continue later.

11:13.463 --> 11:16.023
(Jiang)
I told Brother

11:16.073 --> 11:17.503
his plan wouldn't work.

11:17.503 --> 11:19.013
We shouldn't return them.

11:25.273 --> 11:26.633
What...?

11:29.103 --> 11:30.583
Who brought these back?

11:30.583 --> 11:31.603
Master,

11:31.623 --> 11:32.833
I think Duke An's Mansion

11:32.833 --> 11:34.133
had them sent back.

11:34.153 --> 11:35.833
We weren't sure what to do

11:36.033 --> 11:37.443
and asked Ms. Xiao to come here.

11:37.463 --> 11:38.423
I had sent them

11:38.423 --> 11:39.673
to Duke An's Mansion.

11:39.673 --> 11:41.323
How come they were moved back?

11:41.343 --> 11:42.443
Send them over again.

11:42.463 --> 11:44.933
Master, their butler said

11:44.953 --> 11:46.323
if you resent them,

11:46.343 --> 11:48.383
they'd bring them back again.

11:51.553 --> 11:54.433
Did they return the gifts?

11:54.463 --> 11:57.023
Sending them back and forth

11:57.153 --> 11:58.833
was a lot of work.

12:01.033 --> 12:02.893
Don't be upset.

12:02.913 --> 12:05.473
This shows that they like Si so much

12:05.473 --> 12:07.253
that they refuse to cancel the engagement.

12:07.273 --> 12:08.383
Young Master Ji

12:08.383 --> 12:09.983
lost his head for the moment.

12:09.983 --> 12:11.543
He'll still marry Si

12:11.543 --> 12:13.223
and treat her well.

12:16.223 --> 12:17.743
Brother.

12:20.073 --> 12:22.263
Our mansion has become

12:22.553 --> 12:24.713
a laughingstock because of you.

12:24.713 --> 12:27.103
Look what you've done.

12:28.863 --> 12:29.963
Servants.

12:29.983 --> 12:31.343
Bring all these back.

12:31.343 --> 12:32.413
Get them out of my sight!

12:32.433 --> 12:33.483
Yes.

12:33.503 --> 12:35.553
You're brilliant, Master.

12:35.553 --> 12:36.843
Brother didn't even

12:36.863 --> 12:39.143
consider his daughter's name.

12:39.583 --> 12:40.943
Darling,

12:41.503 --> 12:43.743
don't fan the flames.

12:44.463 --> 12:46.623
Now that the gifts are back again,

12:47.193 --> 12:48.713
I'm relieved.

12:51.623 --> 12:54.083
Sir, over here, over here.

12:54.103 --> 12:55.863
Nice view.

12:56.793 --> 12:58.793
Water vitalizes the land.

12:58.793 --> 13:01.793
True. This river links
the Inner and Outer Cities.

13:03.193 --> 13:04.323
You have a dog, too.

13:04.343 --> 13:05.253
Be careful.

13:05.273 --> 13:06.633
Careful.

13:06.703 --> 13:09.153
Good. This house is conveniently located.

13:09.173 --> 13:10.533
(Zaoshu Lane)
He doesn't bite.

13:10.553 --> 13:11.913
That's good.

13:12.153 --> 13:14.793
Earl Dongping's Mansion lies ahead.

13:14.913 --> 13:16.833
This is its north side.

13:18.273 --> 13:20.143
Feel free to look around.

13:20.503 --> 13:22.413
Check out the table, chairs,

13:22.433 --> 13:23.313
and the bed.

13:23.313 --> 13:24.483
They're brand new.

13:24.503 --> 13:25.863
The Outer City is

13:25.863 --> 13:27.203
less safe than the Inner City.

13:27.223 --> 13:28.743
It's good to keep a dog

13:28.743 --> 13:30.343
to guard the house.

13:30.553 --> 13:32.373
(Er'niu, Yu Qi's Army Dog)
Er'niu isn't a pet.

13:32.383 --> 13:34.073
He's a pure army...

13:35.673 --> 13:36.513
Here.

13:36.533 --> 13:37.503
He's a handsome

13:37.503 --> 13:39.913
and majestic treasure.

13:39.913 --> 13:41.273
Yes, a treasure.

13:42.673 --> 13:43.833
The rich and the poor

13:43.833 --> 13:45.933
live separately in town.

13:45.953 --> 13:47.713
Most of the privileged

13:47.713 --> 13:48.553
and powerful figures

13:48.563 --> 13:49.963
dwell in the Inner City.

13:49.983 --> 13:51.323
Sir,

13:51.343 --> 13:53.363
if you aren't strapped for cash,

13:53.383 --> 13:54.433
it's better to

13:54.433 --> 13:56.793
purchase properties in the Inner City.

13:57.073 --> 13:58.503
No, thanks. I'll take this one.

13:58.503 --> 14:00.103
According to the law,

14:00.103 --> 14:01.383
to buy this house,

14:01.383 --> 14:02.953
we have to ask

14:02.953 --> 14:04.083
the owner's relatives

14:04.103 --> 14:05.653
and the neighbors first.

14:05.673 --> 14:06.983
If they won't buy it,

14:06.983 --> 14:08.053
you can take it.

14:08.073 --> 14:09.433
Go ask them then.

14:11.173 --> 14:14.453
(Jiang)

14:15.103 --> 14:17.083
Only Long Dan and I will live there.

14:17.103 --> 14:18.383
His life will be much easier.

14:18.383 --> 14:19.503
I don't need a servant.

14:19.503 --> 14:20.353
The size of that house

14:20.353 --> 14:21.603
is perfect for you.

14:21.623 --> 14:23.253
- Mr. Yu.
- Miss Jiang.

14:23.273 --> 14:25.383
What house are you talking about?

14:25.583 --> 14:26.223
Mr. Yu will move

14:26.223 --> 14:27.433
into that house on Zaoshu Lane.

14:27.433 --> 14:28.403
He's asking the neighbors

14:28.403 --> 14:30.123
if anyone else wants to buy it.

14:31.343 --> 14:32.583
We're going to

14:32.583 --> 14:33.963
purchase that courtyard.

14:33.983 --> 14:34.993
Others can't

14:34.993 --> 14:36.383
live there.

14:37.193 --> 14:39.893
Wait. When did we decide to...?

14:39.913 --> 14:41.623
I'm sorry, Mr. Yu.

14:41.623 --> 14:42.793
We've long decided

14:42.793 --> 14:43.913
to buy that house

14:43.913 --> 14:45.153
on Zaoshu Lane.

14:45.153 --> 14:46.753
Sorry for the inconvenience.

14:47.103 --> 14:48.323
It's fine.

14:48.343 --> 14:50.323
Name your price, Miss Jiang.

14:50.343 --> 14:52.533
What do you want to give up that house?

14:52.553 --> 14:53.913
Think about it.

14:57.673 --> 14:59.033
Er'niu.

14:59.273 --> 15:01.953
Sorry, he isn't himself today.

15:11.613 --> 15:15.813
(The South, Yu Qi's Courtyard)

15:27.673 --> 15:29.403
♪ From place to place ♪

15:29.403 --> 15:34.343
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

15:34.713 --> 15:37.093
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

15:37.093 --> 15:41.323
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

15:42.033 --> 15:44.433
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

15:44.453 --> 15:48.113
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

15:48.133 --> 15:51.553
♪ Growing between us ♪

15:51.703 --> 15:57.223
♪ And breeding love ♪

15:58.953 --> 16:00.403
This way, please, ma'am.

16:02.033 --> 16:03.203
Over here.

16:03.223 --> 16:04.583
Sister.

16:18.253 --> 16:21.493
(Ji Chongyi, Duke An's Heir)

16:28.273 --> 16:29.953
We have honorable guests.

16:29.953 --> 16:32.073
No wonder I didn't see others.

16:32.343 --> 16:33.973
Greetings, Duchess An.

16:33.973 --> 16:35.773
(Ms. Wei, Duchess An)

16:44.983 --> 16:47.473
I'm here to apologize.

16:48.073 --> 16:49.793
Please forgive me, Father-in-law.

16:49.793 --> 16:51.363
Stop.

16:51.383 --> 16:53.303
I'm not your father-in-law.

16:53.343 --> 16:55.473
I had the betrothal gifts returned yesterday,

16:55.473 --> 16:56.693
but you didn't take them.

16:56.713 --> 16:58.493
Now that you're here,

16:58.513 --> 17:00.773
go home with them now.

17:00.793 --> 17:03.913
We can't take them back.

17:08.343 --> 17:09.563
Duchess An,

17:09.583 --> 17:10.903
Si was hurt.

17:10.903 --> 17:12.753
It's understandable that her father

17:12.753 --> 17:14.323
is mad.

17:14.343 --> 17:15.863
Chongyi made a mistake.

17:15.863 --> 17:18.403
As his mother, I won't cover for him.

17:18.423 --> 17:20.713
His father has given him physical punishment.

17:21.033 --> 17:23.453
I hope Earl Dongping and Miss Si

17:23.473 --> 17:24.903
can give him another chance.

17:24.903 --> 17:26.433
Give him another chance

17:26.513 --> 17:28.113
to kill my sister again?

17:28.113 --> 17:29.473
Kill her?

17:29.943 --> 17:31.213
Young Master Zhan,

17:31.233 --> 17:32.623
what makes you say that?

17:32.623 --> 17:33.753
Didn't your son tell you

17:33.753 --> 17:35.033
he pushed Si into the river?

17:35.033 --> 17:35.873
Zhan,

17:35.883 --> 17:37.743
don't interrupt when elders speak.

17:37.863 --> 17:40.313
Chongyi, what happened?

17:40.313 --> 17:42.183
It wasn't like that, Mother.

17:42.183 --> 17:43.113
Tell them the truth.

17:43.113 --> 17:44.873
Say it!

17:45.183 --> 17:46.033
Father-in-law,

17:46.033 --> 17:47.553
Miss Si slipped

17:47.553 --> 17:48.463
and fell.

17:48.463 --> 17:49.623
It was an accident.

17:49.623 --> 17:50.943
I have witnesses.

17:50.943 --> 17:52.343
They can vouch for me.

17:52.343 --> 17:53.253
Young Master Zhan,

17:53.273 --> 17:54.553
you can't accuse me of murder

17:54.553 --> 17:56.013
without any proof.

17:56.033 --> 17:57.863
I know my son, Chongyi.

17:57.863 --> 17:59.873
He's a good boy. He'd never

17:59.873 --> 18:02.063
do such evil deeds.

18:02.273 --> 18:03.923
That day, after Miss Si fell,

18:03.943 --> 18:04.943
our whole family was

18:04.943 --> 18:06.213
worried sick,

18:06.233 --> 18:07.913
especially Chongyi.

18:08.033 --> 18:10.233
He insisted on jumping off to find her.

18:10.233 --> 18:11.073
Have a seat, ma'am.

18:11.073 --> 18:12.503
Be seated.

18:13.033 --> 18:14.033
Brother,

18:14.033 --> 18:15.553
look, he has kneeled down

18:15.553 --> 18:16.553
and apologized.

18:16.553 --> 18:18.363
Clearly, it's a misunderstanding.

18:18.383 --> 18:20.053
- That's it.
- He insisted on jumping off?

18:20.073 --> 18:22.293
Wasn't he in a rush to check

18:22.313 --> 18:23.963
if I drowned

18:23.983 --> 18:24.863
so that he could

18:24.863 --> 18:26.233
marry his lover?

18:26.233 --> 18:27.593
Si,

18:27.993 --> 18:29.423
you're an unmarried girl.

18:29.423 --> 18:31.053
Watch your mouth.

18:31.073 --> 18:32.213
Miss Si,

18:32.233 --> 18:33.733
I study sages' teachings.

18:33.753 --> 18:35.473
I'd never harm girls.

18:35.473 --> 18:36.753
Not to mention you're

18:36.753 --> 18:38.743
my fiancée.

18:39.033 --> 18:40.843
Trust me, Miss Si.

18:40.863 --> 18:41.943
Once you two get married,

18:41.943 --> 18:42.793
I'll treat you

18:42.793 --> 18:44.943
as my own daughter.

18:44.943 --> 18:46.643
No one can hurt you.

18:46.663 --> 18:48.473
If Chongyi is mean to you,

18:48.473 --> 18:49.953
I'll punish him.

18:52.423 --> 18:55.063
Greetings, Mother.

18:55.343 --> 18:58.063
Chongyi didn't come home again last night?

18:58.143 --> 19:00.433
Your husband doesn't come back,

19:00.443 --> 19:01.313
leaving you alone.

19:01.313 --> 19:03.263
That's your fault. You're useless.

19:03.753 --> 19:05.183
Chongyi keeps going out

19:05.183 --> 19:07.713
simply because you're unattractive.

19:07.993 --> 19:09.843
You should at least learn from others

19:09.863 --> 19:11.353
and dress yourself up.

19:11.513 --> 19:13.263
You're too dull.

19:20.233 --> 19:21.873
I understand.

19:24.793 --> 19:26.433
Have some tea, Mother.

19:29.863 --> 19:31.623
You're coquettishly dressed.

19:31.623 --> 19:33.223
Who are you going to seduce?

19:33.713 --> 19:35.193
Get lost.

19:40.143 --> 19:41.403
Do you hear that, Si?

19:41.423 --> 19:42.993
Your mother-in-law is wonderful.

19:42.993 --> 19:45.313
You'll enjoy a happy marriage for sure.

19:45.313 --> 19:47.053
Am I right, Brother?

19:47.073 --> 19:49.013
If you agree to marry my son,

19:49.033 --> 19:51.293
let's set the wedding day today.

19:51.313 --> 19:52.423
I can't wait to

19:52.423 --> 19:54.583
see you marry my son.

19:54.943 --> 19:55.973
Ms. Wei,

19:55.993 --> 19:57.073
my decision is the same.

19:57.073 --> 19:58.433
No.

19:59.513 --> 20:01.453
I'm being kind enough

20:01.473 --> 20:03.163
to come to your house.

20:03.183 --> 20:04.533
As per the law,

20:04.553 --> 20:05.793
to cancel the engagement,

20:05.793 --> 20:07.633
you'll be flogged 60 times.

20:07.713 --> 20:10.233
Think twice, Miss Si.

20:10.233 --> 20:11.943
Fine. We can

20:11.943 --> 20:13.223
go to the place where justice

20:13.223 --> 20:14.453
will be served by law.

20:14.473 --> 20:16.643
Not only will the engagement be canceled,

20:16.663 --> 20:18.473
but Young Master Ji will also be

20:18.473 --> 20:19.833
guilty of murdering his fiancée

20:19.833 --> 20:20.973
to cover up his affair!

20:20.993 --> 20:22.353
Right!

20:23.943 --> 20:25.303
Miss Si...

20:25.343 --> 20:26.583
Duke An's Mansion isn't afraid

20:26.583 --> 20:28.113
of a humble girl like you.

20:28.583 --> 20:30.363
If you insist on going to court,

20:30.383 --> 20:32.393
we'll see you there.

20:34.313 --> 20:35.603
By the way, Ms. Wei,

20:35.623 --> 20:37.843
bring the betrothal gifts back with you

20:37.863 --> 20:39.253
to spare us the trouble

20:39.273 --> 20:40.783
of sending them again.

20:44.623 --> 20:45.843
Don't argue with them.

20:45.863 --> 20:47.693
We'll settle everything in court.

20:47.713 --> 20:49.073
Sister, do you remember

20:49.073 --> 20:50.353
where exactly he pushed you

20:50.353 --> 20:51.983
into the river?

20:52.143 --> 20:53.453
I need witnesses.

20:53.473 --> 20:54.563
I'm trying to recall

20:54.583 --> 20:55.553
who could've seen him

20:55.553 --> 20:56.773
pushing me off the bridge.

20:56.793 --> 20:58.153
Miss Jiang.

20:58.663 --> 21:00.873
- Mr. Yu.
- Why are you still here?

21:02.313 --> 21:03.623
I meant to negotiate

21:03.623 --> 21:05.603
with you about that house

21:05.623 --> 21:07.633
and stuck around.

21:07.863 --> 21:09.993
Sorry, I overheard your home affairs.

21:09.993 --> 21:11.743
I meant to leave,

21:12.103 --> 21:14.223
but thinking that you might

21:14.223 --> 21:16.343
need my help,

21:16.343 --> 21:18.293
I stayed for a few more minutes.

21:18.313 --> 21:20.193
I need your help?

21:22.583 --> 21:25.583
Who got you out of the water?

21:27.073 --> 21:28.503
You did.

21:28.623 --> 21:30.643
You saved my sister, Mr. Yu?

21:30.663 --> 21:32.023
That was nothing.

21:34.143 --> 21:35.123
Mr. Yu,

21:35.143 --> 21:36.423
you saved

21:36.423 --> 21:37.513
both of us.

21:37.513 --> 21:39.143
Starting today, I, Jiang Zhan...

21:39.143 --> 21:40.753
Mr. Yu, did you also see me

21:40.753 --> 21:42.163
being pushed into the river?

21:42.183 --> 21:43.453
No, actually.

21:43.473 --> 21:44.553
But I know

21:44.553 --> 21:46.363
who might've seen it.

21:46.383 --> 21:47.983
- Who was it?
- Who was it?

21:48.683 --> 21:50.743
About that house...

21:55.863 --> 21:56.823
It's negotiable.

21:56.843 --> 21:57.713
Great!

21:57.713 --> 21:59.033
We're going to be neighbors.

21:59.033 --> 22:00.253
- Right.
- Mr. Yu,

22:00.273 --> 22:01.713
never did I know we'd share

22:01.713 --> 22:03.033
such a deep bond.

22:03.033 --> 22:04.393
Yes, indeed.

22:37.233 --> 22:38.743
Young Master Ji!

22:40.423 --> 22:41.823
Miss Si.

23:02.943 --> 23:04.303
Miss,

23:04.423 --> 23:06.633
are you worried about the suit?

23:15.993 --> 23:17.053
Miss,

23:17.073 --> 23:18.773
don't stay up too late.

23:18.793 --> 23:19.903
You almost drowned.

23:19.903 --> 23:21.973
The cold energy remains in your body.

23:21.993 --> 23:24.293
Aman, fetch an umbrella.

23:24.313 --> 23:25.603
It's too late.

23:25.623 --> 23:27.153
Where are you going?

23:27.423 --> 23:28.983
I'm going to see a friend.

23:33.493 --> 23:36.613
(Qiaoxiang Shop)

24:12.493 --> 24:16.693
(Qiaoniang, Owner of Qiaoxiang Shop)

24:16.713 --> 24:18.073
There you are.

24:23.033 --> 24:25.023
I knew you'd come.

24:25.383 --> 24:27.023
I'm glad to see

24:27.423 --> 24:28.953
you're fine.

24:28.993 --> 24:31.193
Did Ji Chongyi go to a tryst

24:31.993 --> 24:33.433
with you that day?

24:33.993 --> 24:35.353
Yes.

24:35.383 --> 24:37.393
How candid.

24:38.033 --> 24:39.873
I'm somewhat surprised.

24:39.943 --> 24:41.053
Thanks to you

24:41.073 --> 24:42.973
I can sell the incense I made

24:42.993 --> 24:44.403
in your shop these years

24:44.423 --> 24:46.583
to earn money

24:46.863 --> 24:48.363
to support my family.

24:48.383 --> 24:50.673
The business was slow back then.

24:51.233 --> 24:52.513
Then the unique incense

24:52.513 --> 24:53.773
you created

24:53.793 --> 24:55.673
swept the city

24:55.833 --> 24:58.153
and saved my shop from bankruptcy.

24:58.663 --> 24:59.503
Taste it.

24:59.513 --> 25:01.023
I made them for you.

25:04.423 --> 25:05.783
It's really good!

25:07.273 --> 25:08.363
What's this?

25:08.383 --> 25:09.883
The key to my shop.

25:09.903 --> 25:11.013
Keep it safe.

25:11.033 --> 25:12.533
When you feel bored at home,

25:12.553 --> 25:13.453
or when you're sad,

25:13.473 --> 25:14.693
come to my shop anytime.

25:14.713 --> 25:16.713
Consider it your second home.

25:16.903 --> 25:18.603
- After Qian got married...
- Is it for me?

25:18.623 --> 25:19.883
I felt lonely.

25:19.903 --> 25:21.833
You tried everything to cheer me up.

25:21.833 --> 25:22.683
Thanks, Qiaoniang.

25:22.683 --> 25:24.153
- I knew
- You're the best.

25:25.583 --> 25:27.923
you treated me as your sister.

25:27.943 --> 25:30.193
You're like my best sister, too.

25:31.233 --> 25:32.593
You were like that.

25:39.343 --> 25:40.913
There's no point

25:40.993 --> 25:42.943
in hiding the truth from you anymore.

25:42.993 --> 25:45.233
Among all those kinds of incense here,

25:45.233 --> 25:48.303
which one do you think is made for me?

25:48.753 --> 25:50.193
Let me think about it.

25:50.423 --> 25:52.053
Show Miss Si the most expensive incense

25:52.073 --> 25:53.403
you have here.

25:53.423 --> 25:54.403
My treat.

25:54.423 --> 25:56.233
No, thanks, Young Master Ji.

25:56.233 --> 25:57.183
This Fruit Incense

25:57.183 --> 25:58.343
is nothing expensive,

25:58.343 --> 25:59.553
but tons of scholars

25:59.553 --> 26:01.163
love it.

26:01.183 --> 26:02.623
It's my favorite, too.

26:02.623 --> 26:04.013
It has a pleasant smell,

26:04.033 --> 26:07.433
able to calm the mind.

26:07.903 --> 26:09.533
He can't be trusted.

26:09.553 --> 26:11.213
He doesn't like me, actually.

26:11.233 --> 26:12.713
He hit on me only to use my money

26:12.713 --> 26:14.033
to pay off his gambling debts.

26:14.033 --> 26:15.973
You knew all that?

26:15.993 --> 26:17.813
He thought he played me like a fiddle,

26:17.833 --> 26:20.193
but I simply played along

26:20.423 --> 26:22.123
to climb up the ladder

26:22.143 --> 26:23.953
and attain a higher status.

26:24.383 --> 26:25.913
You wouldn't understand.

26:27.343 --> 26:29.013
My father was at the bottom

26:29.033 --> 26:30.123
of society

26:30.143 --> 26:32.263
and abused to death by the powerful.

26:32.343 --> 26:33.643
After he died,

26:33.663 --> 26:34.813
I swore

26:34.833 --> 26:36.183
not to be a humble

26:36.183 --> 26:37.493
and lowly businesswoman.

26:37.513 --> 26:38.383
When Ji Chongyi

26:38.383 --> 26:40.153
laid eyes on me,

26:40.183 --> 26:41.983
I couldn't run away,

26:42.903 --> 26:45.063
but I didn't want to be his toy either.

26:45.343 --> 26:46.293
I decided to use him

26:46.313 --> 26:47.793
to marry into Duke An's Mansion

26:47.793 --> 26:49.123
and change my life.

26:49.143 --> 26:51.013
How silly, Qiaoniang!

26:51.033 --> 26:52.943
You were jumping into the abyss.

26:52.943 --> 26:53.803
Businesswomen

26:53.813 --> 26:55.713
struggle in the abyss every day.

26:55.773 --> 26:56.663
We're always

26:56.663 --> 26:58.073
criticized and judged

26:58.073 --> 26:59.163
by countless decent people.

26:59.183 --> 27:00.183
The more money we make,

27:00.183 --> 27:02.113
the more we're blamed.

27:02.623 --> 27:04.323
In terms of marriage,

27:04.343 --> 27:05.383
businesswomen

27:05.383 --> 27:06.513
won't be accepted

27:06.513 --> 27:07.493
by families of officials.

27:07.493 --> 27:09.113
Businessmen also despise us.

27:09.513 --> 27:11.743
They won't marry us either.

27:11.863 --> 27:13.453
Those poor scholars

27:13.473 --> 27:15.233
only sweet-talk us

27:15.233 --> 27:16.603
into giving them money.

27:16.623 --> 27:17.833
Once they become officials,

27:17.833 --> 27:18.673
they'll abandon us

27:18.673 --> 27:20.163
and divorce us.

27:20.183 --> 27:21.923
I didn't mean to jump into the abyss.

27:21.943 --> 27:23.593
I simply chose the most rewarding one

27:23.593 --> 27:25.353
among all of them.

27:26.473 --> 27:28.503
I'm not marrying Ji Chongyi

27:31.663 --> 27:33.393
but his powerful clan!

27:34.903 --> 27:36.213
Only in that way

27:36.233 --> 27:37.313
can I secure a bright future

27:37.313 --> 27:38.843
for my child.

27:38.863 --> 27:39.753
He'll be of noble birth

27:39.753 --> 27:42.063
and won't be abused by the powerful.

27:42.233 --> 27:43.673
Child?

27:48.583 --> 27:50.053
Are you pregnant?

27:50.073 --> 27:52.493
Your mother's family was
the richest in Lingshui.

27:52.513 --> 27:53.873
Even she chose to bring a fortune

27:53.873 --> 27:55.233
to marry an earl

27:55.553 --> 27:56.663
because

27:56.663 --> 27:58.713
her children would be of noble birth.

27:58.713 --> 28:00.843
Their future could be expected.

28:00.863 --> 28:02.423
You want to use that baby

28:02.423 --> 28:04.163
to gain a foothold in Duke An's Mansion,

28:04.183 --> 28:05.273
but how can you be sure

28:05.273 --> 28:06.713
it's a boy?

28:06.713 --> 28:08.913
If it's a boy, that'd be the best.

28:09.143 --> 28:10.543
If not,

28:10.903 --> 28:12.773
I'll give birth to twins.

28:12.793 --> 28:13.973
A boy and a girl.

28:13.993 --> 28:15.923
You've even planned that out.

28:15.943 --> 28:18.023
Only if I can cross the threshold

28:18.553 --> 28:20.253
will my and my baby's status

28:20.273 --> 28:22.123
become more secure.

28:22.143 --> 28:25.783
Sorry, I betrayed you, Si.

28:27.133 --> 28:30.253
(Earl Dongping's Mansion)

28:30.273 --> 28:32.273
What? Cancel it?

28:32.273 --> 28:34.533
(Lady Jiang, Earl's Mother)
Yes, Grandmother.

28:34.553 --> 28:36.033
I only meditated

28:36.033 --> 28:38.273
in the mountain for half a month.

28:38.273 --> 28:41.713
Is Si going to turn our house upside down?

28:42.383 --> 28:44.143
I tried to change her mind over and over

28:44.143 --> 28:45.233
until my throat hurt.

28:45.233 --> 28:46.463
But she had no respect for me

28:46.463 --> 28:47.563
at all

28:47.583 --> 28:50.533
and threatened to go to court.

28:50.553 --> 28:52.743
Is she going to turn a joyful event

28:52.793 --> 28:54.913
into a suit?

28:55.183 --> 28:56.453
Grandmother,

28:56.473 --> 28:57.873
Si also

28:57.873 --> 28:59.323
slapped my mother.

28:59.343 --> 29:00.973
Don't bring that up.

29:00.993 --> 29:02.563
It was humiliating.

29:02.583 --> 29:03.923
But that girl was

29:03.943 --> 29:05.183
so heartless

29:05.183 --> 29:06.913
as to hurt her family.

29:07.423 --> 29:10.473
My face still hurts.

29:11.313 --> 29:12.403
That girl was

29:12.423 --> 29:13.793
way out of line.

29:13.793 --> 29:15.733
How wildly audacious of her!

29:15.753 --> 29:17.183
Fu, go now.

29:17.183 --> 29:18.883
Fetch Si.

29:18.903 --> 29:20.583
Yes, My Lady.

29:25.713 --> 29:27.943
Have some tea, Grandmother.

29:27.943 --> 29:29.303
Don't be mad.

29:40.233 --> 29:41.563
My Lady,

29:41.583 --> 29:43.423
the maid in her chamber said

29:43.423 --> 29:44.623
she didn't feel well.

29:44.623 --> 29:45.583
She's still sleeping.

29:45.583 --> 29:46.733
What?

29:46.753 --> 29:47.713
Look what time it is.

29:47.713 --> 29:49.083
Is she still in bed?

29:49.103 --> 29:51.193
See, Grandmother?

29:51.273 --> 29:52.773
Xiao,

29:52.793 --> 29:55.353
is this how you manage the household?

29:57.553 --> 29:59.823
I'm incompetent, Mother.

29:59.903 --> 30:02.123
But ever since she

30:02.143 --> 30:03.663
fell into the river,

30:03.663 --> 30:05.503
she has become a different person.

30:05.553 --> 30:07.083
She's been so wild

30:07.103 --> 30:09.503
as if she's given herself up.

30:09.623 --> 30:11.073
How did Ancheng

30:11.073 --> 30:13.263
discipline his daughter?

30:13.473 --> 30:15.273
Forget about him.

30:15.273 --> 30:16.383
When Si stirred up trouble,

30:16.383 --> 30:17.623
he didn't stop her

30:17.623 --> 30:19.343
but went to Duke An's Mansion

30:19.343 --> 30:20.793
to cancel the engagement himself.

30:20.793 --> 30:22.103
He claimed

30:22.103 --> 30:23.643
that he wouldn't give up until he

30:23.663 --> 30:25.493
received the Letter of Annulment.

30:29.273 --> 30:30.813
Let's go.

30:30.833 --> 30:32.233
I'd like to see

30:32.253 --> 30:33.113
how sick Si is

30:33.113 --> 30:34.353
that she can't

30:34.353 --> 30:36.023
get out of bed!

30:36.023 --> 30:39.573
(Peace)

30:40.903 --> 30:42.473
My Lady, Ms. Xiao,

30:42.473 --> 30:43.833
Miss Pei.

30:44.713 --> 30:46.693
Grandmother just returned from the mountain.

30:46.713 --> 30:47.833
She missed Si

30:47.833 --> 30:49.163
and had her maid fetch her.

30:49.183 --> 30:50.223
She was perfectly fine

30:50.223 --> 30:51.583
to cancel her engagement yesterday.

30:51.583 --> 30:53.163
How come she's too sick to get up now?

30:53.183 --> 30:54.843
She had almost drowned

30:54.863 --> 30:56.293
and then caught a cold yesterday.

30:56.313 --> 30:57.383
That's why...

30:57.383 --> 30:58.733
Let me check on her, I insist.

30:58.753 --> 31:00.623
Wait. Stop, Miss Pei!

31:00.623 --> 31:01.983
Miss Pei...

31:04.343 --> 31:06.033
Aman, Pei is here.

31:06.033 --> 31:07.103
Why didn't you tell me?

31:07.103 --> 31:08.603
What's this?

31:08.623 --> 31:09.833
I felt cold from top to bottom

31:09.833 --> 31:11.983
and had a foot bath with ginger water.

31:12.913 --> 31:14.513
- Mother!
- It's fine. Calm down.

31:14.513 --> 31:16.053
Welcome back, Grandmother.

31:16.073 --> 31:17.053
Mother.

31:17.073 --> 31:18.433
Kneel!

31:26.073 --> 31:27.693
(I kneeled too many times before.)

31:27.713 --> 31:28.793
(I foolishly believed)

31:28.793 --> 31:30.033
(if I got down on my knees, )

31:30.033 --> 31:31.593
(problems would be solved.)

31:32.753 --> 31:34.323
Si,

31:34.343 --> 31:35.533
do you know

31:35.553 --> 31:37.663
how many people envy

31:37.663 --> 31:39.693
your engagement with Duke An's heir?

31:39.713 --> 31:41.033
Your two married cousins will gain

31:41.033 --> 31:42.233
more respect from our in-laws.

31:42.233 --> 31:43.843
Over the past year,

31:43.863 --> 31:44.863
those who have come

31:44.863 --> 31:46.353
to propose to your third cousin

31:46.353 --> 31:48.383
are of a much higher class.

31:48.383 --> 31:49.443
The truth is

31:49.463 --> 31:50.623
they're eager

31:50.623 --> 31:53.543
to form a link with Duke An's Mansion.

31:53.583 --> 31:55.783
How short-sighted.

31:56.343 --> 31:57.823
What was that?

31:58.863 --> 31:59.773
Nothing.

31:59.793 --> 32:02.633
I understand, Grandmother.

32:04.513 --> 32:06.163
You look more obedient

32:06.183 --> 32:08.823
when your grandmother is back.

32:09.793 --> 32:11.403
Well then,

32:11.423 --> 32:12.313
let's

32:12.313 --> 32:14.713
apologize to Duke An's Mansion

32:14.833 --> 32:16.823
and proceed with the marriage.

32:18.863 --> 32:21.583
Fine. It's all up to you, Aunt Xiao.

32:25.663 --> 32:27.183
Grandmother, may I

32:27.183 --> 32:28.363
get up now?

32:28.383 --> 32:29.823
Don't move.

32:30.383 --> 32:31.423
Look how much trouble

32:31.423 --> 32:32.553
you've stirred up,

32:32.553 --> 32:35.253
causing unnecessary conflicts
between the two clans.

32:35.273 --> 32:37.143
Kneel there to reflect on yourself

32:37.143 --> 32:39.633
for two hours.

32:40.623 --> 32:42.023
Be careful, Mother.

32:42.553 --> 32:44.993
You said she had changed after that incident.

32:44.993 --> 32:47.473
But to me, she seems the same as before.

32:47.513 --> 32:49.713
Perhaps I thought too much.

32:53.623 --> 32:55.113
Flog her.

32:56.233 --> 32:57.593
Do it!

32:58.033 --> 32:59.033
Don't! Stop!

32:59.033 --> 33:00.553
- Zhan!
- Grandmother!

33:00.553 --> 33:02.513
I dare you to shield her!

33:02.513 --> 33:04.673
Please think twice, Mother.

33:05.313 --> 33:06.183
Ji Chongyi

33:06.183 --> 33:08.363
pushed Si into the river.

33:08.383 --> 33:11.643
He's not a good man!

33:11.663 --> 33:13.493
Don't be silly, Brother.

33:13.513 --> 33:16.073
He's Duke An's heir.

33:16.073 --> 33:17.993
It's so lucky of you

33:17.993 --> 33:20.253
to marry your daughter up to him.

33:20.273 --> 33:22.163
Don't nitpick.

33:22.183 --> 33:23.273
Si represents

33:23.273 --> 33:25.353
the entire Jiang Clan.

33:26.033 --> 33:27.493
If the lineal daughter

33:27.513 --> 33:29.013
is so selfish

33:29.033 --> 33:30.113
as to file a suit

33:30.113 --> 33:31.253
to cancel her engagement,

33:31.273 --> 33:32.183
she'll

33:32.183 --> 33:34.033
bring shame on our whole clan

33:34.033 --> 33:35.943
and ruin our name!

33:35.943 --> 33:37.873
- You...
- You're right.

33:37.943 --> 33:39.863
Si is being unruly

33:39.863 --> 33:40.973
and acting without scruple.

33:40.993 --> 33:42.383
I won't tolerate that.

33:42.383 --> 33:43.653
What does Earl Dongping's Mansion

33:43.653 --> 33:44.813
value the most?

33:44.833 --> 33:45.833
Our name!

33:45.833 --> 33:47.183
I won't allow anyone

33:47.183 --> 33:48.383
to tarnish it!

33:48.383 --> 33:50.013
- But...
- What?

33:50.033 --> 33:52.453
Duke An's Mansion is at fault.

33:52.473 --> 33:54.053
Once she marries the heir,

33:54.073 --> 33:56.483
his family will make it up to her.

33:56.503 --> 33:58.363
They won't mistreat her.

33:58.383 --> 34:01.543
What exactly is the problem?

34:04.023 --> 34:05.293
Grandmother,

34:05.313 --> 34:06.273
Si refuses to marry him.

34:06.273 --> 34:07.863
Could you please not push her?

34:07.863 --> 34:09.593
What? Are you on her side?

34:09.593 --> 34:10.713
Flog them both!

34:10.713 --> 34:12.073
Yes.

34:12.313 --> 34:13.573
Father!

34:13.593 --> 34:14.613
Do it!

34:14.633 --> 34:15.733
Father!

34:15.753 --> 34:17.433
Ancheng.

34:26.633 --> 34:28.423
Enough, Grandmother!

34:28.423 --> 34:29.423
Please stop!

34:29.423 --> 34:30.343
I'll marry him!

34:30.343 --> 34:32.193
I'll marry Ji Chongyi!

34:32.193 --> 34:33.553
Stop.

34:36.673 --> 34:38.103
Brother!

34:42.903 --> 34:44.663
Brother!

34:48.543 --> 34:49.913
Miss, Miss!

34:51.273 --> 34:53.353
(Morning Drizzle)
You had meant to cancel

34:53.353 --> 34:55.003
your engagement in court.

34:55.023 --> 34:56.543
Just now, in front of Lady Jiang,

34:56.543 --> 34:59.003
you said it was all up to Ms. Xiao

34:59.023 --> 35:00.483
to proceed with the marriage.

35:00.503 --> 35:02.063
What were you thinking?

35:02.113 --> 35:04.213
We'll still go to court,

35:04.233 --> 35:05.403
but

35:05.423 --> 35:07.213
we have to be discreet.

35:07.233 --> 35:09.353
Grandmother can't know before it happens.

35:17.753 --> 35:20.913
(Court)
Send in the drummer!

35:26.903 --> 35:27.773
Your Honor,

35:27.793 --> 35:29.293
I'm filing a suit.

35:29.313 --> 35:30.673
Take her paper.

35:43.543 --> 35:44.653
Granted.

35:44.673 --> 35:46.543
The hearing will be held later.

35:46.633 --> 35:49.103
Who exactly saw me fall into the river?

35:49.233 --> 35:50.903
I have a question.

35:50.903 --> 35:51.833
Do you mind

35:51.833 --> 35:53.573
enlightening me first?

35:53.593 --> 35:54.773
What is it?

35:54.793 --> 35:56.323
I saved your life

35:56.343 --> 35:57.943
and then volunteered to help you

35:57.943 --> 35:59.403
find the witnesses.

35:59.423 --> 36:00.463
I didn't ask for any return

36:00.463 --> 36:02.703
or offend you, did I?

36:02.903 --> 36:03.923
No.

36:03.943 --> 36:06.193
Why did you keep pushing me away

36:06.193 --> 36:07.633
from your neighborhood?

36:07.633 --> 36:09.143
Am I such an eyesore?

36:09.673 --> 36:11.653
I also have a question for you.

36:11.673 --> 36:13.063
In all of Ling'an,

36:13.063 --> 36:14.253
among all those houses,

36:14.273 --> 36:15.383
why pick the one

36:15.383 --> 36:17.213
right next to our mansion?

36:17.233 --> 36:20.093
Because your brother and I

36:20.113 --> 36:21.983
bonded straight away.

36:22.063 --> 36:23.733
I think he also wants me

36:23.753 --> 36:25.153
to live closer to him

36:25.153 --> 36:27.143
so that we can see each other often.

36:27.343 --> 36:28.503
My brother's always been

36:28.503 --> 36:30.153
kind and friendly.

36:30.153 --> 36:32.363
He's nice to everyone.

36:32.383 --> 36:34.043
He has so many friends

36:34.063 --> 36:35.733
but forgets them quickly.

36:35.753 --> 36:37.253
Don't take such a bond

36:37.273 --> 36:38.883
too seriously.

36:38.903 --> 36:40.323
You know what?

36:40.343 --> 36:41.273
I happen to adore

36:41.273 --> 36:43.023
carefree men like him.

36:43.023 --> 36:44.883
Hearing what you just said,

36:44.903 --> 36:46.813
I want to be his neighbor even more.

36:46.833 --> 36:48.133
Stop beating around the bush.

36:48.153 --> 36:49.343
Who are the witnesses?

36:49.343 --> 36:50.353
If you don't know,

36:50.353 --> 36:51.813
then stop wasting my time.

36:51.833 --> 36:53.153
This matter is too important.

36:53.153 --> 36:54.363
Don't fool me.

36:54.383 --> 36:56.393
I know, of course.

36:57.113 --> 36:59.623
See? They're the witnesses.

37:00.233 --> 37:01.463
They're right across the place

37:01.463 --> 37:03.393
where you fell.

37:03.423 --> 37:05.193
(Wonton)
Others might not have seen you,

37:05.193 --> 37:06.253
but they

37:06.273 --> 37:07.633
certainly did.

37:28.863 --> 37:30.523
(Cancel the engagement, )

37:30.543 --> 37:32.913
(then I can start all over again, right?)

37:33.593 --> 37:34.983
(This time, )

37:35.193 --> 37:36.613
(I'll change my life.)

37:36.623 --> 37:39.833
♪ Sprinkles stopped ♪

37:39.853 --> 37:43.373
♪ Liquor filled the cup ♪

37:43.373 --> 37:50.023
♪ Clothes wet; lotus fragrant ♪

37:50.233 --> 37:53.403
♪ In Ling'an ♪

37:53.423 --> 37:56.973
♪ I ride, looking for flowers ♪

37:56.973 --> 38:00.473
♪ Nice as it is ♪

38:00.493 --> 38:07.993
♪ It's not home ♪

38:10.943 --> 38:12.123
Ji Chongyi,

38:12.143 --> 38:14.543
Jiang Si accused you of attempted murder.

38:15.133 --> 38:16.583
How do you plead?

38:17.063 --> 38:19.443
Not guilty, Your Honor.

38:19.463 --> 38:21.253
That was an accident.

38:21.273 --> 38:22.503
I think that girl slipped

38:22.503 --> 38:24.483
and fell into the water.

38:24.503 --> 38:26.313
I heard someone else

38:26.313 --> 38:27.313
gave her family

38:27.313 --> 38:28.233
more betrothal gifts.

38:28.233 --> 38:30.353
That's why they're suing Duke An's heir.

38:30.793 --> 38:33.153
Was she promised to two families?

38:33.173 --> 38:34.543
- Nonsense!
- Yes, that's right.

38:34.543 --> 38:35.673
That's not true.

38:35.673 --> 38:37.773
- Were you sent by the defendant?
- Who's he?

38:37.793 --> 38:38.883
Your Honor,

38:38.903 --> 38:40.543
I have witnesses.

38:40.673 --> 38:41.843
Send them in.

38:41.863 --> 38:44.703
- Send them in!
- Send them in!

38:49.093 --> 38:50.933
(Guard the State and People)

38:50.943 --> 38:51.903
Master,

38:51.903 --> 38:53.843
say something!

38:53.863 --> 38:55.093
Other things aside,

38:55.113 --> 38:56.233
should we

38:56.233 --> 38:58.703
try to buy Mr. Zhen over?

38:59.233 --> 39:01.093
What's your decision?

39:01.113 --> 39:03.463
Others can be bought over,

39:03.463 --> 39:04.863
(Duke An)

39:04.863 --> 39:06.813
but Zhen Heng of Capital Security

39:06.833 --> 39:08.153
is too rigid and stubborn.

39:08.153 --> 39:09.843
He won't be swayed by anyone.

39:09.863 --> 39:12.213
Sometimes even His Majesty

39:12.233 --> 39:14.273
has to compromise.

39:14.343 --> 39:16.063
That's why

39:16.383 --> 39:17.983
he's got the hardest job

39:17.983 --> 39:20.353
to be the Vice Prefect

39:20.383 --> 39:21.773
of Capital Security.

39:21.793 --> 39:23.133
Your name.

39:23.153 --> 39:25.363
Wang Dongsheng, Your Honor.

39:25.383 --> 39:26.923
Occupation.

39:26.943 --> 39:30.273
I'm a waiter at a wonton shop.

39:30.403 --> 39:32.193
Answer my question.

39:32.253 --> 39:33.273
What

39:33.273 --> 39:34.983
did you see that night?

39:40.153 --> 39:42.913
I was by the river,

39:42.943 --> 39:44.293
but it was too dark.

39:44.313 --> 39:45.813
I barely saw anything.

39:45.833 --> 39:47.293
You're in court.

39:47.313 --> 39:48.793
Do not lie.

39:49.233 --> 39:51.273
What exactly did you see?

39:53.113 --> 39:54.603
I didn't get a good look.

39:57.293 --> 39:59.213
(Ji Chongli, Ji Chongyi's Brother)

40:01.113 --> 40:01.983
But I've

40:01.983 --> 40:03.883
said in public

40:03.903 --> 40:06.143
Young Master Ji pushed Miss Si.

40:06.673 --> 40:08.003
I heard

40:08.023 --> 40:09.023
your mother is

40:09.023 --> 40:11.023
old and lame.

40:11.833 --> 40:13.473
What do you want?

40:16.793 --> 40:19.173
It was too dark that night.

40:19.193 --> 40:21.183
You barely saw anything.

40:28.313 --> 40:29.673
Jiang Si,

40:29.833 --> 40:31.503
what do you have to say?

40:33.023 --> 40:34.173
Your Honor,

40:34.193 --> 40:35.403
I have another witness,

40:35.423 --> 40:37.793
the owner of an artwork shop, Song Lin.

40:39.833 --> 40:42.623
Greetings, Your Honor.

40:43.503 --> 40:45.023
I did see Miss Si

40:45.023 --> 40:46.663
fall into the river,

40:46.863 --> 40:48.093
but

40:48.113 --> 40:50.143
she slipped and fell.

40:51.193 --> 40:52.553
Song Lin,

40:52.793 --> 40:54.733
did you see it clearly?

40:54.753 --> 40:56.363
Yes, Your Honor.

40:56.383 --> 40:58.663
I got a good look at what happened.

40:59.233 --> 41:00.813
You two may leave.

41:00.833 --> 41:02.913
Yes, Your Honor.

41:17.793 --> 41:19.133
Looks like someone

41:19.153 --> 41:20.923
pushed me into the water

41:20.943 --> 41:22.693
and suborned the witnesses.

41:22.713 --> 41:24.253
It was dark and slippery.

41:24.273 --> 41:26.733
Their view might've been affected.

41:26.753 --> 41:29.043
Great wits have short memories, huh?

41:29.063 --> 41:30.693
I held a lantern that night.

41:30.713 --> 41:32.023
If it could shine a light

41:32.023 --> 41:33.523
on your dirty business,

41:33.543 --> 41:34.983
it could certainly light up the path.

41:34.983 --> 41:36.913
You're lying!

41:39.343 --> 41:41.923
Your Honor, we did bicker.

41:41.943 --> 41:42.793
Miss Si

41:42.793 --> 41:44.293
lost her temper,

41:44.313 --> 41:45.273
and she somehow

41:45.273 --> 41:47.093
fell into the river.

41:47.113 --> 41:48.173
Miss Si,

41:48.193 --> 41:49.813
I know you're mad at me,

41:49.833 --> 41:51.593
but you cannot lie

41:51.593 --> 41:53.753
to frame me in court.

41:53.983 --> 41:56.593
Your Honor, what's the sentence

41:56.593 --> 41:58.273
for a frame-up?

41:58.903 --> 42:01.833
Your Honor, I have one more witness.

42:03.463 --> 42:04.873
Who else?

42:06.593 --> 42:09.093
The girl Ji Chongyi dated that night,

42:09.113 --> 42:10.523
Qiaoniang.

42:10.543 --> 42:11.773
Right.

42:11.793 --> 42:12.983
She was the closest person

42:12.983 --> 42:14.433
to the scene.

42:14.713 --> 42:16.073
Guards.

42:16.343 --> 42:17.983
Send Sun Qiaoniang in.

42:18.503 --> 42:20.543
Send Qiaoniang in!

42:29.633 --> 42:31.543
I, Sun Qiaoniang, greet you,

42:31.713 --> 42:33.313
Your Honor.

42:33.753 --> 42:34.963
Sun Qiaoniang,

42:34.983 --> 42:36.543
answer my question.

42:37.023 --> 42:39.193
Did Ji Chongyi push Jiang Si

42:39.193 --> 42:40.363
into the river?

42:40.383 --> 42:43.213
Qiaoniang, tell the truth.

42:43.233 --> 42:45.273
I'm here. Don't be afraid.

42:49.093 --> 42:53.493
(The End of Episode 2)

42:53.903 --> 42:55.633
♪ From place to place ♪

42:55.633 --> 43:00.573
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:00.943 --> 43:03.323
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:03.323 --> 43:07.553
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:08.263 --> 43:10.663
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:10.683 --> 43:14.343
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:14.363 --> 43:17.783
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:17.933 --> 43:23.453
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:24.273 --> 43:27.953
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:27.953 --> 43:32.033
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:32.273 --> 43:34.013
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.033 --> 43:38.733
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:38.733 --> 43:42.303
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:42.323 --> 43:46.553
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:46.573 --> 43:48.353
♪ Time glows ♪

43:48.353 --> 43:52.893
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:52.913 --> 43:57.713
♪ And stars ♪

44:01.943 --> 44:04.473
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:04.493 --> 44:08.113
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.133 --> 44:11.563
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:11.583 --> 44:16.203
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.203 --> 44:19.893
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:19.913 --> 44:24.003
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.113 --> 44:25.933
♪ Time glows ♪

44:25.933 --> 44:30.483
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:30.503 --> 44:34.203
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:34.223 --> 44:38.383
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:38.563 --> 44:40.323
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:40.323 --> 44:44.843
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:44.843 --> 44:48.483
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:48.503 --> 44:54.173
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:55.863 --> 44:57.793
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:57.793 --> 45:05.293
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
